---
import {
  buildTrendState,
  editorialFeaturedProjects,
  editorialWatchlist,
  formatCompactNumber,
  formatMomentum,
} from '../../lib/projects';
import { baseUrl } from '../../lib/site';
---

<section class="shell two-column">
  <div class="section-panel content-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Editorial Desk</p>
        <h2>不只看數字，也給使用者一點編輯判斷</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="button ghost" href={`${baseUrl}community/`}>看提報規則</a>
    </div>

    <div class="list-stack">
      {editorialFeaturedProjects.map((entry) => (
        <article class="stack-item">
          <div class="rank-meta">
            <span class="pill">{entry.project.category}</span>
            <span class="pill subtle">{entry.angle}</span>
            <span>{entry.kicker}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{entry.project.fullName}</h3>
          <p class="muted">{entry.summary}</p>
          <p class="data-kicker">{entry.whyNow}</p>
          <div class="rank-meta">
            <span>{formatCompactNumber(entry.project.stars)} stars</span>
            <span>{formatMomentum(entry.project)}</span>
            <span>{buildTrendState(entry.project).label}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <a class="button compact" href={`${baseUrl}projects/${entry.project.slug}/`}>看詳情</a>
            <a class="button ghost compact" href={entry.project.repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
              GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-panel sidebar-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Next To Watch</p>
        <h2>接下來可以持續經營的題目</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="list-stack">
      {editorialWatchlist.map((item, index) => (
        <div class="flow-step">
          <strong>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} {item.title}</strong>
          <p class="muted">{item.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="notice">
      <p>
        這一塊是故意做成「人工可編輯」，不是全靠算法。之後你只要改
        <code>src/data/editorial-notes.json</code>，首頁精選就會跟著換。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
